A quoted item's inner quoted run continues under the outer prefix

```
> - > {.x
>      .y}
plain
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <blockquote><p>{.x
.y}
plain</p></blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
> - > {.x
>     .y}
plain
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <blockquote><p>{.x
.y}
plain</p></blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```
